Package: kdrcc
Type: Package
Title: Kernel-Based Doubly Robust Case-Crossover Regression
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Peizheng", "Li", email = "pzli25@m.fudan.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimates nonlinear joint exposure associations in individually
    matched case-crossover data using a regularized kernel criterion built
    from a doubly robust estimating equation. Provides independent kernel
    learning, matched-set cross-fitting, auxiliary-adjusted covariance,
    configuration selection, effect contrasts, interaction and variable
    participation tests, and baseline Shapley contribution summaries.
License: GPL-3
Depends: R (>= 3.6.3)
Imports: stats, utils, graphics, grDevices, parallel, splines, CompQuadForm (>= 1.4.4)
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: no
